            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "722260201",
                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                    "text": "We'll leave this Perch to you too."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7222603",
            "objective": "",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "722260301",
                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                    "text": "Thanks so much!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "722260302",
                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                    "text": "The Perch seems to be in a good state. I'm sure the ceremony will go well this time!",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "722260303",
                            "text": "Easy-peasy.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "722260305",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Hehe. We're pretty seasoned travelers, after all!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "722260306",
                                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                                    "text": "#Actually, {NICKNAME}, where are you from?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "722260307",
                                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                                    "text": "The people who came before talked about places called Inazuma and Narukami Island. Are you from Inazuma?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "722260308",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "If you're speaking relatively..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "722260309",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Huh, that's right, we did come from Narukami Island, didn't we... Wait a moment!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "722260310",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Paimon's almost forgotten that we're here for the Maushiro!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "722260312",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "That's true..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "722260313",
                                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                                    "text": "..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "722260314",
                                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                                    "text": "Wow! You even climbed on top of a dragon?",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "722260315",
                                            "text": "Well, it was a pretty uncomfortable affair.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "722260317",
                                                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                                                    "text": "That's so awesome..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "722260318",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "The world's a big place, kiddo!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "722260319",
                                                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                                                    "text": "I never knew that there were so many places outside the Sea of Fog. If I leave someday, I'd love to see all of them!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "722260320",
                                                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                                                    "text": "They always tell us that our souls will become lost if we leave the fog, and that the fog protects us from the darkness outside."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "722260321",
                                                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                                                    "text": "But I've met quite a few people from the outside. That's why I know that the Sea of Silence must be inhabited somehow."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "722260322",
                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                    "text": "You can come with us if you have the chance."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "722260323",
                                                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                                                    "text": "Alright! It's a deal, then!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "722260324",
                                                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                                                    "text": "You two go ahead first!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "722260325",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Once the ceremony's over, let's explore the world outside Tsurumi Island together!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "722260326",
                                                    "speaker": "Ruu",
                                                    "text": "Sure!"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "722260316",
                                            "text": "It was alright."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "722260304",
                            "text": "It was pretty dicey."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
